      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I understand that my suggestion felt dismissive when you are in such intense pain, and I hear how valid your feeling of being fundamentally broken is. When the primary source of your structure is gone, the idea of \"self-care\" can sound utterly hollow and pointless. Please know that your struggle is real, and the desire to stop when pain is this absolute is a sign of how deeply you are hurting. If thoughts of ending things feel like the only logical option, I urge you immediately to contact a crisis hotline; they are equipped to help you navigate this exact tipping point.",
